% The customs background (lpsPlus docs/strategy/FactsBackground.md §5.4,
% §6.1): trade usage, stated by the authors. The rules for which no text
% was found: the words of sellers that no public text defines, and what is
% taken as the share of a fibre when a listing names the fibres without
% their shares. A derived fact says "according to trade usage"; a reader of
% the memo can refuse it, and the strict and full readings leave it out.
%
% Used only to read facts from a text (language reference §14.5).

the target language is: prolog.

the functions are:
    the kind of *a good* is *a kind*.
    the fabric construction of *a garment* is *a construction*.
    the material that predominates by weight in *a garment* is *a material*.

the templates are:
    *a thing* is called *a name*; undefined.
    the field *a field* of *a thing* reads *a value*; undefined.
    *a thing* is made of the fabric *a name*; undefined.
    *a thing* names the material *a name*; undefined.
    *a thing* names first the material *a name*; undefined.
    *a name* is a seller's word for the kind *a kind*.
    *a name* is a seller's fabric of construction *a construction*.
    *a name* is a seller's word for the polymer *a polymer*.
    the kind of *a good* is *a kind*.
    the fabric construction of *a garment* is *a construction*.
    *a good* contains *a number* percent of *a material*.
    the material that predominates by weight in *a garment* is *a material*.
    *a good* has a coating of plastics.
    *a thing* is a component of *a good*.
    *a name* is a dictionary rendering of the Chinese term *a term*.
    *a term* is a Chinese term for the construction *a construction*.

the knowledge base trade usage includes these resources:
    materials.

the knowledge base trade usage includes:

the authors is published at "https://github.com/LogicalContractsOrg".
the Youdao dictionary entry is published at "https://dict.youdao.com/result?word=%E6%A2%AD%E7%BB%87&lang=en".
the text of the Youdao dictionary entry is at "sources/trade_usage/youdao_suozhi.txt".
the Chinese Wikipedia article is published at "https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A2%AD%E7%BB%87".
the text of the Chinese Wikipedia article is at "sources/trade_usage/zhwiki_suozhi.txt".

% The value "Tat" of the field "Craft of Weaving" (the listing format). The
% Chinese-English dictionaries give "tat" and "tatting" as the first English
% words for 梭织 (Youdao; also iciba and dict.cn, in sources/trade_usage), and
% 梭织 is weaving, the name set against 针织, knitting (the Chinese Wikipedia;
% Youdao: "梭织是区别于针织的称法", "纺织科学技术 woven"). No text says that
% the marketplace renders its Chinese values with that dictionary word: that
% one step is the authors'. "tatting" is left out: in English it is also a
% lace made by hand, so the word can mean what it says.
"tat" is a dictionary rendering of the Chinese term "梭织",
    as stated in the Youdao dictionary entry, confer "1 tat 用梭织法编织".
"梭织" is a Chinese term for the construction woven,
    as stated in the Chinese Wikipedia article, confer "梭织（英语：Weaving）指将纱线经纬交错织成布料的方法".

rule construction_by_rendered_term with provenance the authors:
the fabric construction of a garment is a construction
    if the field "craft of weaving" of the garment reads a value
    and the value is a dictionary rendering of the Chinese term a term
    and the term is a Chinese term for the construction the construction.

% the field of a set speaks of its parts (the listing format: "A listing
% offers one finished product for sale")
rule construction_by_rendered_term_parts with provenance the authors:
the fabric construction of a component is a construction
    if the component is a component of a good
    and the field "craft of weaving" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a dictionary rendering of the Chinese term a term
    and the term is a Chinese term for the construction the construction.

% a set of garments sold together (the apparel terminology publication:
% "Ensembles ... are sets of garments")
rule seller_words_20 with provenance the authors:
"two piece set" is a seller's word for the kind ensemble.
% a set of garments sold together (the apparel terminology publication:
% "Ensembles ... are sets of garments")
rule seller_words_21 with provenance the authors:
"2 piece set" is a seller's word for the kind ensemble.
% a set of garments sold together (the apparel terminology publication:
% "Ensembles ... are sets of garments")
rule seller_words_22 with provenance the authors:
"matching sets" is a seller's word for the kind ensemble.
% a set of garments sold together (the apparel terminology publication:
% "Ensembles ... are sets of garments")
rule seller_words_23 with provenance the authors:
"matching set" is a seller's word for the kind ensemble.
rule seller_words with provenance the authors:
"tee" is a seller's word for the kind T-shirt.
rule seller_words_2 with provenance the authors:
"tees" is a seller's word for the kind T-shirt.
rule seller_words_3 with provenance the authors:
"tee shirt" is a seller's word for the kind T-shirt.
rule seller_words_4 with provenance the authors:
"tshirt" is a seller's word for the kind T-shirt.
rule seller_words_5 with provenance the authors:
"camis" is a seller's word for the kind top.
rule seller_words_6 with provenance the authors:
"cami" is a seller's word for the kind top.
rule seller_fabrics with provenance the authors:
"chiffon" is a seller's fabric of construction woven.
rule seller_fabrics_2 with provenance the authors:
"satin" is a seller's fabric of construction woven.
rule seller_words_7 with provenance the authors:
"bras" is a seller's word for the kind brassiere.
rule seller_words_8 with provenance the authors:
"swimsuit" is a seller's word for the kind swimsuit.
rule seller_words_9 with provenance the authors:
"leggings" is a seller's word for the kind leggings.
% The tariff's own names of kinds that no text in sources/ names as a word
% (the coverage report of FactsBackground §5.2): their own name only.
rule seller_words_10 with provenance the authors:
"jeans" is a seller's word for the kind jeans.
rule seller_words_11 with provenance the authors:
"parka" is a seller's word for the kind parka.
rule seller_words_12 with provenance the authors:
"parkas" is a seller's word for the kind parka.
rule seller_words_13 with provenance the authors:
"dickey" is a seller's word for the kind dickey.
rule seller_words_14 with provenance the authors:
"dickeys" is a seller's word for the kind dickey.
rule seller_words_15 with provenance the authors:
"neck gaiter" is a seller's word for the kind neck gaiter.
rule seller_words_16 with provenance the authors:
"neck gaiters" is a seller's word for the kind neck gaiter.
rule seller_words_17 with provenance the authors:
"arm sleeves" is a seller's word for the kind arm sleeves.
rule seller_words_18 with provenance the authors:
"sweatband" is a seller's word for the kind sweatband.
rule seller_words_19 with provenance the authors:
"sweatbands" is a seller's word for the kind sweatband.
rule seller_polymers_4 with provenance the authors:
"pc" is a seller's word for the polymer polycarbonate.
rule seller_polymers with provenance the authors:
"eva" is a seller's word for the polymer ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer.
rule seller_polymers_2 with provenance the authors:
"pe" is a seller's word for the polymer polyethylene.
rule seller_polymers_3 with provenance the authors:
"pu" is a seller's word for the polymer polyurethane.

rule kind_by_seller_word with provenance the authors:
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a seller's word for the kind the kind.

rule kind_by_seller_field with provenance the authors:
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the field a field of the good reads a name
    and the field is in ["item type", "tops type"]
    and the name is a seller's word for the kind the kind.

rule construction_by_seller_fabric with provenance the authors:
the fabric construction of a garment is a construction
    if the garment is made of the fabric a name
    and the name is a seller's fabric of construction the construction.

rule polymer_by_seller_word with provenance the authors:
the polymer of a good is a polymer
    if the good names the material a name
    and the name is a seller's word for the polymer the polymer
    and it is not the case that
        the good is a textile article.

rule resin_is_plastics with provenance the authors:
a good is made of plastics
    if the good names the material "resin"
    and it is not the case that
        the good is a textile article.

rule plastics_by_seller_word with provenance the authors:
a good is made of plastics
    if the good names the material a name
    and the name is a seller's word for the polymer a polymer
    and it is not the case that
        the good is a textile article.

% the presumption of the customs presumptions (glove_coating_plastics, from
% subheading 6116.10: "Impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with
% plastics or rubber") for the sellers' abbreviations of plastics
rule glove_coating_seller_word with provenance the authors:
a good has a coating of plastics
    if the kind of the good is a kind
    and the kind is in [gloves, mittens, mitts]
    and the fabric construction of the good is a construction
    and the good names the material a name
    and the name is a seller's word for the polymer a polymer.

% one fibre named, and no share: the whole
rule one_material_whole with provenance the authors:
a good contains 100 percent of a material
    if the good is a textile article
    and the good names the material a name
    and the name is a word for the textile material the material
    and it is not the case that
        the good names the material an other name
        and the other name is different from the name.

rule one_material_named_first with provenance the authors:
a good contains 100 percent of a material
    if the good is a textile article
    and the good names first the material a name
    and the name is a word for the textile material the material
    and it is not the case that
        the good names the material an other name
        and the other name is different from the name.

% several fibres named, and no share: the first named predominates
rule first_named_predominates with provenance the authors:
the material that predominates by weight in a good is a material
    if the good is a textile article
    and the good names first the material a name
    and the name is a word for the textile material the material
    and the good names the material an other name
    and the other name is different from the name.

scenario dress is:
    the cut of dress indicates women.
    dress names first the material "polyester".
    dress names the material "polyester".
    dress names the material "spandex".
    the cut of tee indicates men.
    tee is called "tees".
    tee names the material "cotton".
    chiefs expects answers ["the material that predominates by weight in dress is polyester"].
    shares expects answers ["tee contains 100 percent of cotton"].
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of tee is T-shirt"].

scenario glove is:
    the kind of glove is gloves.
    the fabric construction of glove is knitted.
    glove names the material "pu".
    coatings expects answers ["glove has a coating of plastics"].

scenario tat is:
    the field "craft of weaving" of dress reads "tat".
    the field "craft of weaving" of outfit reads "tat".
    skirt is a component of outfit.
    the field "craft of weaving" of tee reads "knit".
    constructions expects answers ["the fabric construction of dress is woven", "the fabric construction of outfit is woven", "the fabric construction of skirt is woven"].

query constructions is:
    the fabric construction of which garment is which construction.

query coatings is:
    which good has a coating of plastics.

query chiefs is:
    the material that predominates by weight in which garment is which material.

query shares is:
    which good contains which number percent of which material.

query kinds is:
    the kind of which good is which kind.
